+# Persistence rollback notes
+
+Knowledge persistence remains on the existing `documents`, `embeddings`, and `deliveries` tables.
+This change only relocates code into `packs/knowledge` and routes document reads through `Knowledge::Catalog`.
+
+To roll back: move files from `packs/knowledge/app` back to top-level `app/`, remove the knowledge pack,
+and restore the root `package.yml` dependencies list. No migrations were added; dropping tables is not required.
